{"articleNo":"1414","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1414&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"졸업예정자 ICDL자격증과정 수요조사[종료]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.10.04","hit":"10053","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">졸업예정자 ICDL자격증과정 수요조사<br>-과정개설시 선착순으로 강의수강 우선권 부여.(단 서류제출기간에 서류제출자에 한함.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 68.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -68.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 교육목적 : 졸업예정생들에게 <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">ICDL</span> 국제공인 자격증 취득 기회를 제공하고 취업에 유리한 여건 마련</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 교육명 : <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">ICDL자격증과정 - 4주 과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 예정교육기간 : 2010. 11. 08(월) ~ 12. 03(금),&nbsp;16:00~17:50 </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 교육장소 : 우리학교내 글로벌관 408호 </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 수 강 료 : 무료(교재 지급), 응시료 전액지원(단, 과정별 1회에 한함)</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 모집인원 : 25명<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000\"><br></span>□ 교육대상 : 2011년 2월 졸업예정자</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 80.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -80.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">※ 위 대상자외 지원 불가(대학원생지원불가)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 타 교육과 중복신청 절대불가</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">□ 교육내용</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 17.5pt\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"148\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">과정명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"84\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">기간</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"178\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIG